# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LEX-INDIC — Configuration template
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values.  Never commit .env.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ─── REQUIRED — AI provider keys ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get a free Gemini key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# Get a free Groq key at:   https://console.groq.com/keys
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_key_here
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_key_here


# ─── OPTIONAL — White-label PDF letterhead ───────────────────────────────────
# Override these to ship the case-brief PDF under a specific firm's brand.
# All five are optional; defaults fall back to the Lex-Indic branding.
# The "Lex-Indic BNS Transition Engine" attribution stays in the cover-page
# meta row regardless — that's deliberate, it disclaims AI authorship.
#
# LAW_FIRM_NAME=SINGHANIA & PARTNERS
# LAW_FIRM_TAGLINE=ADVOCATES & SOLICITORS
# LAW_FIRM_SUBTITLE=Mumbai · Delhi · Bengaluru
# LAW_FIRM_HEADER=Singhania & Partners | BNS Case Brief | CONFIDENTIAL
# LAW_FIRM_DISCLAIMER=Prepared by Singhania & Partners as a draft. Must be reviewed by the assigned advocate before filing.


# ─── PRODUCTION — Audit-log salt ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# REQUIRED for any production deployment.  This salt is mixed into the SHA-256
# hash of every client story, so hashes can't be cross-referenced across
# customer deployments.  Generate a long random string (32+ chars).
#
# AUDIT_HASH_SALT=replace-this-with-a-long-random-string-per-deployment
# AUDIT_LOG_DIR=outputs/audit


# ─── DEVELOPMENT — Anything else ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# (none required at the moment)
